  "notes": "School is compulsory from 5 to 18. A child must be 5 by July 31 to enter kindergarten, which is left out here as in the US file, so Grade 1 starts at 6. Guam's code sets the elementary grades as first through fifth; GDOE middle schools teach grades 6–8 and its high schools grades 9–12. GDOE is one island-wide K–12 district. Freshman to senior for grades 9–12 is everyday US usage, not from the cited pages."
